the correct answer is \"I only\"." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/state.json" "file_sha256" "8edd8052848e399de5497f12c3bb0d4ee5a67da902cfd1a30702c40e7a639203"} {"question" "q-42116" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "66708c2f91a5a0d7798b7042acc394991fc9eb566947eed6c18c02af47ef0f76"} {"question" "q-42116" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/state.json" "file_sha256" "8edd8052848e399de5497f12c3bb0d4ee5a67da902cfd1a30702c40e7a639203"} {"question" "q-42116" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "I and II only"] ["text" "I and III only"] ["text" "I only"] ["text" "II only"] ["text" "None"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/state.json" "file_sha256" "8edd8052848e399de5497f12c3bb0d4ee5a67da902cfd1a30702c40e7a639203"} {"question" "q-42116" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "I only"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/state.json" "file_sha256" "8edd8052848e399de5497f12c3bb0d4ee5a67da902cfd1a30702c40e7a639203"} {"question" "q-74319" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Consider the matrix \n$D=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}].$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n- $D$ is upper triangular\n- $D$ is lower triangular\n- ${D}^{T}$ is upper triangular" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/state.json" "file_sha256" "8edd8052848e399de5497f12c3bb0d4ee5a67da902cfd1a30702c40e7a639203"} {"question" "q-74319" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false, since $D$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. All the entries above the main diagonal of $D$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. All the entries below the main diagonal of ${D}^{T}$ are zeros:\n\n$$\n{D}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only\"." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/state.json" "file_sha256" "8edd8052848e399de5497f12c3bb0d4ee5a67da902cfd1a30702c40e7a639203"} {"question" "q-74319" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "66708c2f91a5a0d7798b7042acc394991fc9eb566947eed6c18c02af47ef0f76"} {"question" "q-74319" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/state.json" "file_sha256" "8edd8052848e399de5497f12c3bb0d4ee5a67da902cfd1a30702c40e7a639203"} {"question" "q-74319" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "I and II only"] ["text" "I only"] ["text" "II and III only"] ["text" "II only"] ["text" "III only"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/questi