 "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "66708c2f91a5a0d7798b7042acc394991fc9eb566947eed6c18c02af47ef0f76"} {"question" "q-42091" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/state.json" "file_sha256" "8edd8052848e399de5497f12c3bb0d4ee5a67da902cfd1a30702c40e7a639203"} {"question" "q-42091" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "I and III only"] ["text" "I only"] ["text" "II and III only"] ["text" "II only"] ["text" "III only"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/state.json" "file_sha256" "8edd8052848e399de5497f12c3bb0d4ee5a67da902cfd1a30702c40e7a639203"} {"question" "q-42091" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "II and III only"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/state.json" "file_sha256" "8edd8052848e399de5497f12c3bb0d4ee5a67da902cfd1a30702c40e7a639203"} {"question" "q-13771" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Consider the matrix \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}8 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}].$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n- $A$ is upper triangular\n- $A$ is lower triangular\n- ${A}^{T}+A$ is lower triangular" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/state.json" "file_sha256" "8edd8052848e399de5497f12c3bb0d4ee5a67da902cfd1a30702c40e7a639203"} {"question" "q-13771" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true, since all the entries below the main diagonal are zeros:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}8 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true, since all the entries above the main diagonal are zeros:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}8 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true, since the result of $A+{A}^{T}$ has all the entries above the main diagonal equal to zero: \n\n$$\n{A}^{T}+A=[\\begin{aligned}16 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III\"." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/state.json" "file_sha256" "8edd8052848e399de5497f12c3bb0d4ee5a67da902cfd1a30702c40e7a639203"} {"question" "q-13771" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "66708c2f91a5a0d7798b7042acc394991fc9eb566947eed6c18c02af47ef0f76"} {"question" "q-13771" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/state.json" "file_sha256" "8edd8052848e399de5497f12c3bb0d4ee5a67da902cfd1a30702c40e7a639203"} {"question" "q-13771" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "I and II only"] ["text" "I and III only"] ["text" "I only"] ["text" "I, II, and III"] ["text" "II and III only"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14075464/state.json" "file_sha256" "8edd8052848e399de5497f12c3bb0d4ee5a67da902cfd1a30702c40e7a639203"} {"question" "q-13771" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "I, II, and III"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Cou